response:
The report details a cyberattack involving web defacements against Ukrainian government websites, including the Ministry of Foreign Affairs (МЗС) and the Ministry of Education and Science (МОН). Investigation by SSU, Cyberpolice, and Derzhspetszvyazok indicated potential exploitation of vulnerability CVE-2021-32648 in October CMS. Web server software NGINX and APACHE and remediation steps are detailed.

